<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-036" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong" source-id="s-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-ws1492438">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p001:m0000" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA">謝超宗</persName>，陳郡陽夏人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p001:m0012" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAA">靈運</persName>，宋臨川內史。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p001:m0022" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAAB">鳳</persName>，元嘉中坐<persName id="c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p001:m0028" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAA">靈運</persName>事，同徙嶺南，早卒。</p>
</text>
